  m_Name: ArcadeGameSerpentHood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 77
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Hood
  Description: 'Serpents only - a sniper duel across a crystal heart. Hoods stand round the heart,
    every mouth turned to it - sit in a hood''s cup and fire out through its gaps. Charge
    reloads your rifle faster, so the heart is where you load up, in every hood''s sights.
    Hold LT to scope and RT to fire - a round that strips a rival pilot is one snipe. Break
    a hood''s core and the whole hood falls, flushing whoever hid in it. Higher intensities
    pull the hoods in, deepen their cups and stand shutters across the heart. First team to
    the target wins.'
